OL,3,GNEWSAOxford lecturer denies possessing
OL,4,Aindecent child images
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Oxford lecturer is facing trial for
OL,7,Fpossessing indecent images of children.
OL,9,FDr Lola Salem, 33, a lecturer in French
OL,10,Fand music at Oriel College, has denied
OL,11,Fone count of possessing three Category
OL,12,FB images, which is the second most
OL,13,Fserious type, between May 2021 and
OL,14,FFebruary 2023.
OL,16,FShe has also pleaded not guilty to
OL,17,Fpossessing one Category C image between
OL,18,FApril 2021 and February 2023.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
