OL,3,GNEWSAOxford lecturer denies possessing
OL,4,Aindecent child images
OL,5,
OL,6,FOriel College said it was "made aware
OL,7,Fof serious charges against an employee
OL,8,Fin June 2026" and that the employee was
OL,9,F"suspended, pending the outcome of
OL,10,Flegal proceedings".
